    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teller Office &amp; Customer Service</strong>: Manage deposits, withdrawals and open accounts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/0d87fea1b1089a6a0c7f8d203d0dff32.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/0d87fea1b1089a6a0c7f8d203d0dff32.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/0d87fea1b1089a6a0c7f8d203d0dff32.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools (Money Handbag &amp; Tasks Clipboard)</strong>: Use the handbag to fill or empty items, and the clipboard to track your tasks and claim rewards.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/c93a6c310320fea74115449520d462a1.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/c93a6c310320fea74115449520d462a1.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/c93a6c310320fea74115449520d462a1.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds</strong>: Invest in bonds, wait for maturity, and earn profits for the bank.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/988ecb1d5e74301e09b8fd1546fbd5d3.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/988ecb1d5e74301e09b8fd1546fbd5d3.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/988ecb1d5e74301e09b8fd1546fbd5d3.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loans</strong>: Review loan requests carefully to reduce risk and earn interest.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/c2f44765b02ecf26a04d3380888bba99.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/c2f44765b02ecf26a04d3380888bba99.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/c2f44765b02ecf26a04d3380888bba99.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marketing</strong>: Launch campaigns to attract more customers and grow your reputation<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/1db05663c93847607d404acf9a51ecd5.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/1db05663c93847607d404acf9a51ecd5.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/1db05663c93847607d404acf9a51ecd5.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizations</strong>: Make it yours and add your personal touch with furniture, colors, and layout changes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/05324a4528cc0686ecd8b9883cb3dc12.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/05324a4528cc0686ecd8b9883cb3dc12.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/05324a4528cc0686ecd8b9883cb3dc12.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market</strong>: Buy office items, equipment, and decorations to expand your bank.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/d3fb213dc0bd5d9d991dd4cc512ed59b.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/d3fb213dc0bd5d9d991dd4cc512ed59b.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/d3fb213dc0bd5d9d991dd4cc512ed59b.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
