add your personal touch with furniture, colors, and layout changes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/05324a4528cc0686ecd8b9883cb3dc12.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/05324a4528cc0686ecd8b9883cb3dc12.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/05324a4528cc0686ecd8b9883cb3dc12.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market</strong>: Buy office items, equipment, and decorations to expand your bank.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/d3fb213dc0bd5d9d991dd4cc512ed59b.poster.avif?t=1751345689\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/d3fb213dc0bd5d9d991dd4cc512ed59b.webm?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355800/extras/d3fb213dc0bd5d9d991dd4cc512ed59b.mp4?t=1751345689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
